ecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group flex min-h-[7.25rem] flex-col rounded-xl border bg-card p-3.5 outline-none transition-colors hover:border-brand/45 hover:bg-brand-soft/20 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring sm:p-5\" href=\"/demo/nuvo-nuvoriginal-2026/evidence?scope=reception\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium leading-5 text-muted-foreground sm:text-sm\">เสียงตอบรับที่วัดได้</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center tabular-nums mt-1 font-mono text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground sm:text-3xl\"><span class=\"sr-only\">1,602</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-flex items-center\"><span>1,602</span></span></span><span class=\"mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-muted-foreground\">ข้อความที่นำมาวัดผลการตอบรับ</span><span class=\"mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1 pt-2 text-xs font-semibold text-brand\">ดูหลักฐาน<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class=\"mt-3 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border bg-card\"><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex min-w-0 items-start gap-3.5 p-4 sm:border-r sm:p-5\"><span class=\"flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-soft text-brand\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"luci